WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.000
Slingshot Wrestling. Working title. Concept art, not gameplay.

00:03.000 --> 00:06.000
Aim and release: plan the figure’s initial direction.

00:06.000 --> 00:09.000
Use a controlled rope rebound to approach the opponent.

00:09.000 --> 00:12.000
Set up an eligible cover and a three-count pin. Illustrative timing.

00:12.000 --> 00:15.000
Collect, train, and build a stable of original wrestler figures.
